gZX(){return"The relay runs on a server rented from Infomaniak (Switzerland), which also hosts the contact@mirinu.ch mailbox. The same server serves mirinu.ch and app.mirinu.ch, without keeping a log of visits. Cloudflare (United States) is used only for the Turnstile bot check and to check the domain of an email address. For signing in with Google, Google (United States) is involved too. Cloudflare and Google take part in the Data Privacy Framework, which Switzerland and the EU recognize for data sent to the United States."},
gZW(){return"Mirinu does not keep your IP address: to curb abuse, the relay counts requests per address, in an unreadable form erased the next day. It erases a sync without an account 180 days after its last sync, and a space left empty after one day. The relay's nightly backups keep what is erased for up to 7 more days. An email you send is kept while your request is handled."},
